  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
